# backslash-comment-line1: Does a backslash at the end of line 1 of the main file swallow line 2 (XPPAUT 8.2.2)? \
x'=1
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
# xpp: v@3=1
# pc: ok
# ruling: XPPAUT does not apply the backslash rule to line 1 of the main file, so `x'=1` is read; PhaseCont matches. An included file gets no such exemption (backslash-comment-inc).
